    "Boris Johnson defeats Ken Livingstone to take City Hall for the Conservatives",
    "Johnson elected with 53.2% after second preferences",
    "Turnout rises sharply to 44.6%",
    "Conservatives become the largest Assembly party with 11 seats",
    "The BNP wins its first London Assembly seat on 5.4% of the list vote"
